<title>NETHERLANDS: CMG says to buy German software supplier.</title>
<headline>CMG says to buy German software supplier.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch computer services firm Computer Management Group (CMG) said on Monday it had agreed in principle that it would acquire German software supplier Orga Team GmbH.  </p>
<p>Orga Team has turnover of around DM 8 million and employs 26 staff.</p>
<p>CMG said the takeover was expected to be completed in February 1997.</p>
<p>No financial details were given on the deal.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
